cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "orglab: what makes a 'verified' justified in multi-agent systems"
abstract: >-
  Preregistered experiments on how LLM agents verify each other's work: when verifiers confirm success that the
  evidence does not show, which information they need, and which organisational rules catch failures. Includes the
  testbed (orglab), lab book, hypotheses, preregistrations, results and data.
